Subject: Sky quads in one draw (LU_GL_SKY), equal materials set once in
 renderMap (LU_GL_MATREUSE)

The fog bands and the sun and moon halos are quads of one material drawn one after the other: one list, same order, same pixels. renderMap sets the material of a buffer again for every transparent partial buffer; one equal to the one before is skipped.

diff --git a/src/client/clientmap.cpp b/src/client/clientmap.cpp
